      "_id": "6aeaed671154a1055518c194",
      "title": "트럼프는 중간선거 이후 이란과의 전쟁을 재개할까요?",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<p class=\"nv-cover\"><img class=\"nv-cover-img\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XP6FuStdruI/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"트럼프는 중간선거 이후 이란과의 전쟁을 재개할까요?\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">트럼프는 중간선거 이후 이란과의 전쟁을 재개할까요? 주제를 다룬 The Guardian 기사에서 주요 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;Will Donald Trump decide to resume a large-scale war against Iran?&quot; (<mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">resume</mark>)</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">도널드 트럼프는 이란을 상대로 대규모 전쟁을 재개하기로 결정할 것인가?</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. resume: 재개하다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;Iranian officials say they would retaliate for any new US military campaign that...&quot; (<mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">retaliate</mark>)</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">이란 관리들은 미국의 새로운 군사 작전에 대해 보복할 것이라고 말한다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. retaliate: 보복하다, 반격하다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;Trump makes it worse by vacillating between wanting a deal and repeatedly threatening to 'annihilate' Iran.&quot; (<mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">vacillate</mark>)</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">트럼프는 합의를 원하다가도 이란을 '완전히 파괴하겠다'고 거듭 위협하는 등 오락가락하며 상황을 악화시킨다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. vacillate: 갈팡질팡하다, 오락가락하다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;an 'intensive' multi-day attack would force Iran to make new concessions in stalled negotiations.&quot; (<mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">stall</mark>)</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">며칠간의 집중적인 공격이 교착 상태에 빠진 협상에서 이란의 새로운 양보를 끌어낼 것이라는 것이다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. stall: 교착 상태에 빠지다, 진전이 멈추다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;...he has learned from the mistakes that led him into this quagmire.&quot; (<mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">quagmire</mark>)</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">그가 자신을 이 수렁에 빠뜨린 실수들로부터 교훈을 얻었는지.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. quagmire: 수렁, 진퇴양난</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;Or if he will repeat the same mistakes – and hubris – that led him to launch this catastrophic war in the first place.&quot; (<mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">hubris</mark>)</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">아니면 애초에 이 참혹한 전쟁을 시작하게 만든 똑같은 실수와 오만을 되풀이할 것인지.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. hubris: 오만, 자만</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XP6FuStdruI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"board-comments-root nv-related-comments\" data-board-comments-root></div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">The Guardian | Will Trump relaunch his war on Iran after the midterm elections? | By Mohamad Bazzi</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2026/nov/03/trump-iran-war-after-midterm-elections\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
