    {
      "_id": "6aebdb383047b8952b57454f",
      "title": "민주당은 어떻게 새로운 권력을 행사할 것인가?",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<p class=\"nv-cover\"><img class=\"nv-cover-img\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gDHQfaw_ods/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"민주당은 어떻게 새로운 권력을 행사할 것인가?\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">민주당은 어떻게 새로운 권력을 행사할 것인가? 주제를 다룬 The Economist 기사에서 주요 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;Exposing the administration’s perceived <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">self-dealing</mark> will be the biggest focus.&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">행정부가 사익을 추구한다고 여겨지는 행태를 폭로하는 것이 가장 큰 초점이 될 것이다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. self-dealing: 사익 추구, 자기 거래 (명사)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;Democrats might extract concessions on health care, tariffs and other priorities, if they are savvy and Mr Trump is <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">pliable</mark>.&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">민주당이 협상에 능숙하고 트럼프가 설득에 응한다면, 의료와 관세 등 주요 현안에서 양보를 끌어낼 수도 있다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. pliable: 잘 휘어지는, 고분고분한 (형용사)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;Election landslides often <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">engender</mark> hubris, and Democrats are not immune.&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">선거에서의 압승은 흔히 오만을 낳으며, 민주당도 예외는 아니다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. engender: 낳다, 불러일으키다 (동사)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gDHQfaw_ods\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"board-comments-root nv-related-comments\" data-board-comments-root></div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">The Economist | How Democrats will wield their new power</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://www.economist.com/united-states/2026/11/04/how-democrats-will-wield-their-new-power\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
