    {
      "_id": "6aebdb423047b8952b574560",
      "title": "민주당의 놀라운 중간선거 압승",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<p class=\"nv-cover\"><img class=\"nv-cover-img\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sFXWzuNfBNI/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"민주당의 놀라운 중간선거 압승\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">민주당의 놀라운 중간선거 압승 주제를 다룬 The Wall Street Journal 기사에서 주요 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;Voters delivered an astonishing <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">rebuke</mark> to President Trump and his party on Tuesday.&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">유권자들은 화요일 트럼프 대통령과 그의 정당에 놀라울 정도로 강한 질책을 보냈다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. rebuke: 질책, 강한 비판 (명사)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;<mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">Staunchly</mark> Republican states such as Texas, South Carolina and Kansas saw Democratic Senate wins.&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">텍사스와 사우스캐롤라이나, 캔자스처럼 공화당 지지 성향이 확고한 주들에서 민주당 상원 후보들이 승리했다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. staunchly: 확고하게 (부사)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;Democrats took the Senate as well, an <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">upheaval</mark> of power in Washington.&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">민주당은 상원까지 장악하며 워싱턴의 권력 구도에 격변을 일으켰다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. upheaval: 격변, 대변동 (명사)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;Majorities in the House and the Senate would also give Democrats <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">subpoena</mark> power to investigate Trump, his administration, his family and his businesses.&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">하원과 상원에서 과반을 확보하면 민주당은 소환 및 자료 제출 요구 권한도 갖게 되어 트럼프와 그의 행정부, 가족, 사업체들을 조사할 수 있게 된다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. subpoena: 소환장 (명사)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sFXWzuNfBNI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"board-comments-root nv-related-comments\" data-board-comments-root></div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">The Wall Street Journal | Five Takeaways From Democrats’ Stunning Midterm Blowout | By Alex Leary and Lindsay Wise</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://www.wsj.com/politics/elections/five-takeaways-from-democrats-stunning-midterm-blowout-9da38a22\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
