    {
      "_id": "6aec85b85cfe0b3c2f6f081d",
      "title": "밴스, 중간선거 패배 원인으로 이란 전쟁 지목",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<p class=\"nv-cover\"><img class=\"nv-cover-img\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5llwLz8y8ds/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"밴스, 중간선거 패배 원인으로 이란 전쟁 지목\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">밴스, 중간선거 패배 원인으로 이란 전쟁 지목 주제를 다룬 The Economist 기사에서 주요 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;America’s vice-president, J.D. Vance, <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">blamed</mark> his Republican Party’s loss in the midterm elections on the Iran war.&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">미국 부통령 J.D. 밴스는 공화당의 중간선거 패배를 이란 전쟁 탓으로 돌렸다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. blame: 탓하다, 책임을 돌리다 (동)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;Mr Vance’s comments <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">spurred</mark> modest optimism among traders&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">밴스의 발언은 시장 거래자들 사이에서 다소간의 낙관론을 불러일으켰다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. spur: 촉발하다, 자극하다 (동)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;The Kremlin said it hoped Mr Trump’s <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">drubbing</mark> would not affect his ‘peacemaking efforts’&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">크렘린궁은 트럼프의 참패가 그의 ‘평화 중재 노력’에 영향을 주지 않기를 바란다고 밝혔다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. drubbing: 참패, 대패 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;Iran’s government <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">gloated</mark>: one state-run news outlet joked that ‘Trump failed at regime change in Iran but he succeeded in Texas.’&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">이란 정부는 고소해했다. 한 국영 언론은 “트럼프는 이란의 정권 교체에는 실패했지만 텍사스에서는 성공했다”고 비꼬았다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. gloat: 실패를 고소해하다, 의기양양해하다 (동)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5llwLz8y8ds\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"board-comments-root nv-related-comments\" data-board-comments-root></div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">The Economist | World in Brief: Vance blames midterm loss on Iran war</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://www.economist.com/the-world-in-brief/2026/11/05/b0051c30-4ee4-4f7f-9123-247ee8a36de7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
