      "_id": "6aedead68131dbdd1e42c6a9",
      "title": "월가, 기술주 사상 최대폭락 사태",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<p class=\"nv-cover\"><img class=\"nv-cover-img\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/H34kZsKeFsw/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"월가, 기술주 사상 최대폭락 사태\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">월가, 기술주 사상 최대폭락 사태 주제를 다룬 The Wall Street Journal 기사에서 주요 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">The Nasdaq composite stumbled into correction territory, <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">shedding</mark> an estimated $2.5 trillion in total market value.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">나스닥 종합지수가 조정 국면에 진입하면서 전체 시가총액이 약 2조 5천억 달러 줄었다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. shed: 잃다, 줄어들다 (동)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Thursday’s stock-market wipeout left few corners of the tech sector <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">unscathed</mark>.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">목요일 증시 폭락으로 기술 업종에서 타격을 피한 분야는 거의 없었다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. unscathed: 피해를 입지 않은, 타격을 받지 않은 (형)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Underwhelming earnings reports by Amazon and Alphabet sent <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">tremors</mark> across trading desks.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">아마존과 알파벳의 기대에 못 미친 실적 발표가 증권사 매매 부서 전반에 불안의 파장을 일으켰다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. tremor: 진동, 불안의 파장 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Some projects will <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">stall</mark>.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">일부 프로젝트는 진행이 멈출 것이다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. stall: 진행이 멈추다, 정체되다 (동)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\"><mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">Mechanical selling</mark> amplified the losses, said Ben Emons, founder and chief investment officer at FedWatch Advisors.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">페드워치 어드바이저스의 창업자이자 최고투자책임자인 벤 에먼스는 기계적인 매도가 손실을 키웠다고 말했다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. mechanical selling: 기계적인 매도 (명사구)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">The <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">unwind</mark> of bullish bets using borrowed money compounded the pressure.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">빌린 돈으로 주가 상승에 베팅한 투자 포지션이 청산되면서 매도 압력이 더욱 커졌다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. unwind: 투자 포지션의 청산 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H34kZsKeFsw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"board-comments-root nv-related-comments\" data-board-comments-root></div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">The Wall Street Journal | Wall Street Gets $2.5 Trillion AI Reality Check With Historic Rout of Tech Stocks | By David Uberti, Jack Pitcher and Hannah Erin Lang</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://www.wsj.com/finance/stocks/wall-street-gets-2-5-trillion-ai-reality-check-with-historic-rout-of-tech-stocks-93985d7c\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
