      "title": "실업수당 청구 건수 또 다시 감소",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<p class=\"nv-cover\"><img class=\"nv-cover-img\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EewHBOP_wJU/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"실업수당 청구 건수 또 다시 감소\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">실업수당 청구 건수 또 다시 감소 주제를 다룬 The Wall Street Journal 기사에서 주요 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">U.S. jobless claims continued their downslide last week, once again <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">flouting</mark> expectations for an uptick.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">미국의 실업수당 청구 건수는 지난주에도 감소세를 이어가며, 소폭 증가할 것이라는 예상을 또다시 뒤집었다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. flout: 공공연히 무시하다, 예상을 뒤집다 (동)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">The labor market has been holding in a <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">static</mark> low-hire, low-fire mode for months.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">노동시장은 수개월째 채용도 해고도 적은 정체 상태를 유지하고 있다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. static: 정체된, 변화가 없는 (형)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EewHBOP_wJU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"board-comments-root nv-related-comments\" data-board-comments-root></div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">The Wall Street Journal | U.S. Jobless Claims Slide Lower Again | By Dean Seal</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://www.wsj.com/economy/jobs/u-s-jobless-claims-slide-lower-again-54f85605?mod=hp_major_pos1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
